                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Ten badges, and still you walk my ash road. Good. The Descent never really closes - it only banks its coals. Come run the fire again whenever your team needs tempering."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Champion or not, Lavawalker keeps the flame. Every time you climb down here I will be waiting, and so will my Arcanine. The gauntlet is lit."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ignar - the gauntlet is lit",
                    Label: "rematch_ready"
