                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The Cinderfall Descent runs hot and open - I see everyone who steps onto the ash road. I walk the lava so no half-tempered team reaches Scorchspire and shames the last gym. Warm up on my fire."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My Camerupt erupts before it asks questions. This close to the summit, hesitation is just fuel. Battle before the heat decides for you."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You carry the founder-face they burned out of the Scorchspire archives. Do not name it on my road. The fire only respects what you do next."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ignar Lavawalker",
                    Label: "default"
